--
-- Version control: schema is versioned with data (open question 5).  DDL on
-- a branch is invisible on other branches, including to cached plans and
-- functions, and checking out a branch shows its schema.
--
\set ECHO none
commit|t
branch|t
checkout feature|t
feature row|(1,one,7)
feature function|(1,one,7)
1|one|7
feature table|42
checkout main|t
main row|(1,one)
main function|(1,one)
1|one
main has no feature table|t
main has no feature index|t
main columns|id,v
checkout feature again|t
feature dropped vs|t
checkout main again|t
main still has vs|(1,one)
